<title>NETHERLANDS: Shares in ASM Lithography up 10 percent.</title>
<headline>Shares in ASM Lithography up 10 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in semiconductor equipment maker ASM Lithography rose over ten percent in early morning trade on Friday, with investors scrambling to buy it in the aftermath of Thursday's announcement the company had won a $150 million order.</p>
<p>The stock reached a peak of 152.40 guilders, up 17.80 guilders from Thursday's close, then levelled off somewhat to stand at 148.60 guilders at 0746 GMT.</p>
<p>ASM Lithography ended up 8.70 guilders on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
